{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":400,"mirrow":false,"y":-225,"img":"chara006_0","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":400,"mirrow":false,"y":-225,"img":"chara006_0","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"比绍","text":"[show]啊，是的，当然，鄙人的商店。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"比绍","text":"[show]噢，你可能会感到奇怪，你当然会。为什么偌大的驿站只有我这一间商店？[r][l]为什么这间商店的主人又是一位这么富庶而英俊的人类贵族？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"比绍","text":"[show]噢……要不是因为鄙人注定披金戴银的人生中窜出来的那么几个小小的转折，[r]谁会想得到鄙人会在这鸟不拉屎的地方开着这间完全赚不到钱的店呢。呸。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"比绍","text":"[show]说起来……你也是人类啊。这身装扮……嚯，看来你我的境遇也差不多嘛。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"比绍","text":"[show]哦，请不要在意，客人。店再怎么小，也有你想要的一切。[r][l]装备、补给、设计图……总之，请尽情挑选。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"【请问您这里在开商店吗？】","script":"m_1_1_5_1"}